tware, added over Wi-Fi or USB\n- Giant arcade deck in the lot: a person-size stick and 8 sewer-cap buttons you stomp or slap\n- Get out of your car and walk the lot\n- Head look for mouse-look games, aim the controller as a mouse, a full VR keyboard, save anywhere\n\nPowered by DOSBox-X (GPL). Source code: github.com/gainesphere-studios/dos-drive-in\n\nThis is an early build. Please report what works and what doesn't.\n\nDOS Drive-In VR isn't affiliated with the DOSBox-X project. Made by Gainesphere Studios.", "short_description": "Your DOS games on a giant drive-in screen. Park at a drive-in at night, pick a shareware game, and play it from your seat, or get out and work a giant arcade stick and sewer-cap buttons in the lot. Powered by DOSBox-X."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gainesphere.com/pages/dos-drive-in-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gainesphere", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/7tDn2AAXEC", "website_url": "https://gainesphere.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1474680089058665"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1679243676881928"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1679243676881928"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795030020, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1